      - 410.4
      - 349.2
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">样本结构  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">(input, target, gt_specular, gt_gradient), 全部 [1,H,W] 灰度归一化到 [0,1]</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">文件匹配规则  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">① 完全同名 ② input_→target_ ③ input→target ④ 提取数字 target_数字.ext</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">EnhancedPairedTransform  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">水平翻转 / 垂直翻转 / 旋转 / 随机裁剪 resize 回原尺寸 / 亮度缩放 (input+target+gt_spec 同步)</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">HighlightAugmentation (p=0.5)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">随机叠加 1~6 个高斯 blob, 半径 3~max(5,short/20), 强度 0.2~0.7, 同步更新 gt_specular</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">监督目标构造 (增强后)  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">gt_specular = clamp(input - target, 0, 1)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">gt_gradient = normalized_sobel_magnitude(input)</span></p>
    sourceLayout: b28143eb468ecd6cf6a02753303f61151b89d6fe4b72183eac3260d0c613c627
